# DESIGN.md — Airbnb

> Extracted from [https://airbnb.com](https://airbnb.com) on 2026-04-10
> Theme: **light**

## 1. Mood & Atmosphere

A light-themed interface built on Airbnb Cereal VF as the sole typeface. Clean light surfaces with subtle layering and generous whitespace, with a single accent color (#ff385c) used with restraint on CTAs and interactive elements. The spacing system follows a strict 4px base grid. The overall aesthetic is clean, professional, and content-forward.

**Keywords:** light, accent-driven, 4px-grid, clean, professional, airy

## 2. Color Palette

### CSS Custom Properties (copy-paste ready)

```css
:root {
  /* Backgrounds */
  --bg-base: #ffffff;
  --bg-surface-1: #f7f7f7;
  --bg-surface-2: #f2f2f2;
  --bg-surface-3: #dddddd;

  /* Text / Ink */
  --ink-primary: #222222;
  --ink-secondary: #6a6a6a;
  --ink-tertiary: #6c6c6c;
  --ink-disabled: #c1c1c1;

  /* Lines / Borders */
  --line-subtle: #c1c1c1;
  --line-default: #6a6a6a;
  --line-strong: #6c6c6c;

  /* Accent */
  --accent-primary: #ff385c;
  --accent-secondary: #e00b41;

  /* Status */
}
```

### Color Roles

| Role | Token | Value | Usage |
|------|-------|-------|-------|
| Page background | `--bg-base` | #ffffff | Default page/body background |
| Surface 1 | `--bg-surface-1` | #f7f7f7 | Cards, modals, popovers |
| Surface 2 | `--bg-surface-2` | #f2f2f2 | Nested containers, sidebars |
| Primary text | `--ink-primary` | #222222 | Headings, important labels |
| Secondary text | `--ink-secondary` | #6a6a6a | Body text, descriptions |
| Tertiary text | `--ink-tertiary` | #6c6c6c | Captions, metadata, timestamps |
| Disabled text | `--ink-disabled` | #c1c1c1 | Disabled inputs, placeholders |
| Default border | `--line-default` | #6a6a6a | Card borders, dividers, table lines |
| Primary accent | `--accent-primary` | #ff385c | CTAs, links, focus rings, active states |
| Secondary accent | `--accent-secondary` | #e00b41 | Secondary buttons, hover highlights |

### Semantic Naming Suggestions

| Token | Suggested Name | Rationale |
|-------|----------------|-----------|
| `--accent-primary` | `--brand-accent` | Primary interactive color — CTAs, focus rings, active states. |
| `--accent-secondary` | `--brand-secondary` | Supporting accent for secondary actions, links, hover states. |
| `--line-default` | `--divider` | Default border and separator color for cards, tables, and sections. |
| `--bg-surface-1` | `--surface-raised` | First elevation layer — cards, dropdowns, popovers. |

## 3. Typography

### Font Stack

```css
:root {
  --font-display: 'Airbnb Cereal VF', Circular, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Roboto, Helvetica Neue, sans-serif;
}
```

### Type Scale

| Token | Size | Usage |
|-------|------|-------|
| base | 14px | Body text (default) |
| xs | 8px | Fine print, badges |
| sm | 13px | Captions, labels, nav links |
| md | 16px | Subheadings, card titles |
| lg | 18px | Section headings (h3) |
| xl | 20px | Page headings (h2) |
| 2xl | 21px | Hero subheading (h1) |
| 3xl | 22px | Display heading |
| 4xl | 28px | Display hero |

## 4. Spacing

Base unit: **4px**

```css
:root {
  --space-1: 4px;
  --space-2: 8px;
  --space-3: 12px;
  --space-4: 16px;
  --space-5: 20px;
  --space-6: 24px;
  --space-7: 28px;
  --space-8: 32px;
  --space-9: 40px;
  --space-10: 44px;
}
```

Scale: `4 · 8 · 12 · 16 · 20 · 24 · 28 · 32 · 40 · 44`

## 5. Border Radius

```css
:root {
  --radius-sm: 4px;    /* buttons, inputs, tags */
  --radius-md: 14px;   /* cards, containers */
  --radius-lg: 50px;   /* modals, large surfaces */
  --radius-full: 100px; /* pills, avatars */
}
```

## 6. Shadows

```css
:root {
  --shadow-1: rgba(60, 77, 107, 0.25) 0px 0.953955px 1.90791px 0px, rgba(60, 77, 107, 0.25) 0px 3.81582px 5.72373px 0px, rgb(0, 28, 64) 0px 0px 2px 0.5px inset, rgb(215, 235, 255) 0px -1px 3px 0px inset;
  --shadow-2: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.02) 0px 0px 0px 1px, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1) 0px 8px 24px 0px;
  --shadow-3: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.02) 0px 0px 0px 1px, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.04) 0px 2px 6px 0px, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1) 0px 4px 8px 0px;
  --shadow-4: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.02) 0px 0px 0px 1px, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.16) 0px 2px 4px 0px;
  --shadow-5: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.28) 0px 8px 28px 0px;
}
```

### Gradients

```css
--gradient-1: linear-gradient(357.5deg, rgb(62, 86, 124) 1.59%, rgb(58, 84, 117) 21.23%, rgb(45, 60, 91) 58.6%, rgb(128, 157, 192) 97.4%);
--gradient-2: linear-gradient(173.86deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9) 90.56%, rgba(191, 205, 213, 0.9) 82.32%);
--gradient-3: linear-gradient(to top, rgb(255, 255, 255), rgba(0, 0, 0, 0) 50%);
--gradient-4: radial-gradient(50% 50%, rgb(255, 248, 223) 0%, rgba(255, 254, 224, 0.2) 51.5%, rgba(255, 250, 225, 0) 100%);
--gradient-5: linear-gradient(rgb(255, 255, 255) 39.9%, rgb(248, 248, 248) 100%);
```

## 7. Components

### Primary Button
```css
background: rgb(34, 34, 34);
color: rgb(255, 255, 255);
border-radius: 8px;
padding: 11px 18px;
font-size: 14px;
font-weight: 500;
```

### Secondary Button
```css
background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);
color: rgb(34, 34, 34);
border-radius: 20px;
padding: 11px 12px;
font-size: 14px;
font-weight: 500;
border: 0px solid rgb(34, 34, 34);
```

## 8. Do's and Don'ts

### ✅ Do

- **Use Airbnb Cereal VF for all display headings (h1-h3), Airbnb Cereal VF for body and UI text.** — *Maintains the typographic hierarchy observed on the site.*
- **Base all spacing on the 4px grid: 4, 8, 12, 16, 20, 24, 28, 32px.** — *Keeps vertical rhythm and horizontal alignment consistent.*
- **Use border-radius 14px for cards and containers, 4px for buttons and inputs, 100px for pills and avatars.** — *Matches the three-tier radius scale observed in components.*
- **Reserve #ff385c for primary CTAs, focus rings, and active states only.** — *The site uses accent color sparingly — overuse dilutes its impact.*
- **Use #f7f7f7 for elevated surfaces (cards, modals), not #ffffff.** — *Creates visual depth through surface layering.*
- **Use #6a6a6a for all borders and dividers — keep them 1px solid.** — *Consistent, subtle lines maintain the design's restrained feel.*

### ❌ Don't

- **Don't introduce colors outside the extracted palette.** — *Even one off-palette color breaks the visual system.*
- **Don't use font sizes outside the type scale (base: 14px).** — *Ad-hoc sizes create visual noise and inconsistent hierarchy.*
- **Don't mix border-radius values — stick to the sm/md/lg/full scale.** — *Inconsistent rounding is one of the most visible design bugs.*
- **Don't use spacing values that aren't multiples of 4px.** — *Off-grid spacing breaks alignment and looks unpolished.*
- **Don't use pure black (#000000) for large text blocks — use the extracted ink-primary.** — *The site uses a softer near-black for comfortable reading.*
- **Don't use heavy drop shadows — prefer subtle elevation (opacity < 0.1).** — *The design uses light, diffused shadows for depth.*

## 9. Ready-to-Use Prompts

Copy-paste these into your AI coding assistant to generate matching UI:

### Hero section
```
Build a hero section matching Airbnb's design system. Background: #ffffff. Heading: Airbnb Cereal VF, 22px, weight 400, color #222222, letter-spacing -0.035em. Subheading: Airbnb Cereal VF, 16px, color #6a6a6a, line-height 1.5, max-width 540px. Primary CTA: background #ff385c, color #ffffff, padding 16px 24px, border-radius 4px, font-size 13px, weight 500. Section padding: 32px vertical.
```

### Card component
```
Create a card component for Airbnb: background #f7f7f7, border-radius 14px, padding 24px. Border: 1px solid #6a6a6a. Card title: Airbnb Cereal VF, 16px, weight 400, color #222222. Card body: Airbnb Cereal VF, 14px, color #6a6a6a, line-height 1.6. If the card has a footer, separate with 1px #6a6a6a and 20px top padding. Cards should stack in a grid with 20px gap.
```

### Navigation bar
```
Build a sticky nav bar for Airbnb: height 64px, background #ffffff with backdrop-filter blur(12px) and border-bottom: 1px solid #6a6a6a. Logo on the left: Airbnb Cereal VF, 18px, weight 700, color #222222. Nav links: Airbnb Cereal VF, 13px, weight 500, color #6a6a6a, 24px gap. Right side CTA button: background #ff385c, color #ffffff, padding 8px 20px, border-radius 100px. Max-width 1440px, centered, horizontal padding 28px.
```

### Form / Input field
```
Style form inputs for Airbnb: height 44px, background #ffffff, border 1px solid #6a6a6a, border-radius 4px, padding 0 16px. Font: Airbnb Cereal VF, 14px, color #222222. Placeholder color: #c1c1c1. Focus state: border-color #ff385c, box-shadow 0 0 0 3px #ff385c20. Labels: Airbnb Cereal VF, 13px, weight 500, color #6a6a6a, margin-bottom 6px.
```

## 10. Quick-Start CSS Reset

Paste this at the top of your stylesheet to match the extracted design:

```css
*, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

html {
  font-family: 'Airbnb Cereal VF', Circular, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Roboto, Helvetica Neue, sans-serif;
  font-size: 14px;
  line-height: 1.5;
  color: #222222;
  background: #ffffff;
  -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
}

h1, h2, h3 {
  font-weight: 400;
  letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  color: #222222;
}
```

