### ❌ Don't

- **Don't introduce colors outside the extracted palette.** — *Even one off-palette color breaks the visual system.*
- **Don't use font sizes outside the type scale (base: 18px).** — *Ad-hoc sizes create visual noise and inconsistent hierarchy.*
- **Don't mix border-radius values — stick to the sm/md/lg/full scale.** — *Inconsistent rounding is one of the most visible design bugs.*
- **Don't use spacing values that aren't multiples of 4px.** — *Off-grid spacing breaks alignment and looks unpolished.*
- **Don't use pure black (#000000) for large text blocks — use the extracted ink-primary.** — *The site uses a softer near-black for comfortable reading.*
- **Don't use heavy drop shadows — prefer subtle elevation (opacity < 0.1).** — *The design uses light, diffused shadows for depth.*

